<div class="detail_head">
<div class="detail_head1">
    一卡通使用指南</div><div class="clear"></div>

 <div class="content-bt-xia">
            <span>(</span><span>发布时间：2025-07-09</span><span>被阅览数： <script>_showDynClicks("wbnews", 1370298689, 1243)</script>次</span><span>来源：</span><span>)</span>
        </div> 


    <div class="detail_main"><div id="vsb_content_1243_u81"><div id="vsb_content"><p class="vsbcontent_start">一卡通的初始密码为：123456</p><p>一卡通内的证件号：学生卡证件号为学号、教工卡证件号为工资号、临时卡证件号为身份证号</p><p><strong>1、</strong><strong>挂失方法及步骤</strong></p><p>圈存机挂失步骤：</p><p class="vsbcontent_img"><img width="538" height="189" src="/__local/8/BE/68/400218B0707EFF4BAA0AAD4102F_C3A38F55_3502.jpg" vwidth="538" vheight="189" vurl="/_vsl/8BE68400218B0707EFF4BAA0AAD4102F/C3A38F55/3502" vsbhref="vurl" orisrc="/__local/8/BE/68/400218B0707EFF4BAA0AAD4102F_C3A38F55_3502.jpg" class="img_vsb_content"></p><p>携带有效证件（学生证或身份证）在一卡通办公室挂失</p><p><strong>2</strong><strong>、银校转账步骤（仅限交通银行卡）</strong></p><p>银行卡与校园卡之间的绑定</p><p class="vsbcontent_img"><img width="540" height="225" src="/__local/9/9F/CF/3D425D9762262EB448DA05FBDD6_F1F630E8_3161.jpg" vwidth="540" vheight="225" vurl="/_vsl/99FCF3D425D9762262EB448DA05FBDD6/F1F630E8/3161" vsbhref="vurl" orisrc="/__local/9/9F/CF/3D425D9762262EB448DA05FBDD6_F1F630E8_3161.jpg" class="img_vsb_content"></p><p>银行卡与校园卡之间的转账</p><p class="vsbcontent_img"><img width="377" height="545" src="/__local/E/E6/55/C8ECAC2E0E92B2FC8ABCBB102D9_6C781645_3C0A.jpg" vwidth="377" vheight="545" vurl="/_vsl/EE655C8ECAC2E0E92B2FC8ABCBB102D9/6C781645/3C0A" vsbhref="vurl" orisrc="/__local/E/E6/55/C8ECAC2E0E92B2FC8ABCBB102D9_6C781645_3C0A.jpg" class="img_vsb_content"></p><p><strong>3、</strong><strong>支付宝转账步骤</strong></p><p class="vsbcontent_img"><img width="553" height="322" src="/__local/A/60/8B/CABA4CC98B538D061446F606D6E_38FB6053_5B26.jpg" vwidth="553" vheight="322" vurl="/_vsl/A608BCABA4CC98B538D061446F606D6E/38FB6053/5B26" vsbhref="vurl" orisrc="/__local/A/60/8B/CABA4CC98B538D061446F606D6E_38FB6053_5B26.jpg" class="img_vsb_content"></p><p><br></p><p><strong>4、一卡通虚拟卡</strong></p><p>推荐使用校园虚拟卡消费，快捷又方便，请扫描二维码领取虚拟卡，领取完成后可使用付款码在餐厅消费。(未绑定虚拟卡，使用微信、支付宝在餐厅消费将会额外加收20%搭伙费)</p><p>账号为：学号</p><p>密码为：统一身份认证账号密码（业务咨询电话88201650）</p><p>■微信虚拟卡二维码</p><p class="vsbcontent_img"><img src="/__local/7/0A/A4/3B2C626237E9BF9B975BDE310DD_A331392B_2ACA2.png" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/70AA43B2C626237E9BF9B975BDE310DD/A331392B/2ACA2" vheight="" vwidth="" orisrc="/__local/7/0A/A4/3B2C626237E9BF9B975BDE310DD_A331392B_2ACA2.png" class="img_vsb_content"></p><p>■支付宝虚拟卡二维码</p><p class="vsbcontent_img"><img src="/__local/3/AF/82/01A286D5063E2048608B7F44DBF_511CF159_2A969.png" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/3AF8201A286D5063E2048608B7F44DBF/511CF159/2A969" vheight="" vwidth="" orisrc="/__local/3/AF/82/01A286D5063E2048608B7F44DBF_511CF159_2A969.png" class="img_vsb_content"></p><p>5、<strong>设备及办公地址</strong></p><p>南校区圈存机地址：丁香、海棠、竹园食堂一楼；各个宿舍楼楼下；校医院大厅；一卡通办公室。</p><p>北校区圈存机地址：东区、西区食堂；各个宿舍楼楼下；校医院大厅；</p><p>一卡通办公室；图书馆11楼信息网络技术中心办公室。</p><p>南校区一卡通办公地址：南校区一站式服务大厅12号、13号窗口 &nbsp; 电话：81891357</p><p class="vsbcontent_end">北校区一卡通办公地址：教辅楼一楼东 电话：88204626</p></div></div></div>
    <span id="vsb_content_1243_u8" name="vsb_content_1243_u8"></span><br /><br />
    

 
